1
00:00:00,722 --> 00:00:03,762
(Leonard:)She likes everybody
better than she likes me!

2
00:00:10,264 --> 00:00:11,934
(Raj:)How old is this Jell-O?

3
00:00:11,933 --> 00:00:16,003
(Stuart:)Well, it's carrots,
so gonna say very.

4
00:00:17,772 --> 00:00:19,572
(Howard:)Sorry we have to do this.

5
00:00:19,574 --> 00:00:21,274
(Stuart:)Bernadette's not wrong.

6
00:00:21,276 --> 00:00:23,146
(Stuart:)She does work hard around here.

7
00:00:23,145 --> 00:00:24,545
(Raj:)Yeah, maybe it's a good thing

8
00:00:24,546 --> 00:00:26,246
(Raj:)if she stops
babying you so much.

9
00:00:26,248 --> 00:00:28,378
(Howard:)She doesn't baby me.

10
00:00:28,383 --> 00:00:30,883
(Stuart:)I saw her pull you home
in a wagon.

11
00:00:30,886 --> 00:00:33,156
(Howard:)For your information,

12
00:00:33,155 --> 00:00:36,995
(Howard:)I twisted my ankle
chasing the ice cream truck.

13
00:00:36,992 --> 00:00:39,722
(Raj:)Face it, dude, Bernadette
treats you the same way

14
00:00:39,728 --> 00:00:42,998
(Raj:)your mother used to, and that
was not a healthy relationship.

15
00:00:44,965 --> 00:00:46,805
(Leonard:)You're right.
(chuckles)

16
00:00:46,802 --> 00:00:48,102
(Howard:)It's time for me

17
00:00:48,103 --> 00:00:52,303
(Howard:)to act like an adult
in this marriage.

18
00:00:52,307 --> 00:01:02,027
(Howard:)Starting with my husbandly duty
of taking out the trash.

